 * ariada.org/architecture — system architecture, OSS surface, and module map.
 *
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
 *
 * Public transparency page covering the M1-M7 pipeline + C0-C2 scanner
 * runtime stack + HYBRID commodity-outer surfaces + closed cores. Source
 * material: docs/PLATFORM_SPEC.md §3-§4.
 *
 * Audience: NLnet (Stichting NLnet) NGI0 (Next Generation Internet Zero)
 * Commons Fund evaluators, EU public-sector procurement reviewers,
 * downstream OSS contributors, prospective community forks.
 *
 * Reference aesthetic: GitLab Handbook + PostHog Handbook (transparent,
